{"1520710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Entodrive", "steam_appid": 1520710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.poster.avif?t=1747154985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.webm?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.mp4?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay : </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hack Entodrive into your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Battle Entodrive in turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Help the people of Cache Isle with Entodrive related incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Thwart the Forever Corporation's raid of the Isle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face Mystical &amp; mysterious Void Entodrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face your dev partner Max Jai in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Instant Action! (face randomized NPC battles with 5 tiers; lv 20, lv 30, lv 40, lv 50, lv 60)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Upgrade your monsters with ability stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trade / Bartering with NPCs to gain different items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mine for items with your pickaxe in the post game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.poster.avif?t=1747154985\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.webm?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.mp4?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot : </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the developer's for Entodrive AR. An augmented reality game that was made to gamify an outbreak of computer viruses. Your partner in development Max Jai was the face of business, but never got his hands dirty to develop the game. He calls upon your help when realizing Entodrive aren't behaving how they were programed. Entodrive begin attacking and possessing objects in the real world. The Entodrive have become something more than you intended. It is up to you and Max Jai to go on a quest to rediscover what Entodrive means to the people of Cache Isle and save them from Entodrive related incidents. This game takes place in the Apastron universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.poster.avif?t=1747154985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.webm?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.mp4?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay : </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hack Entodrive into your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Battle Entodrive in turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Help the people of Cache Isle with Entodrive related incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Thwart the Forever Corporation's raid of the Isle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face Mystical &amp; mysterious Void Entodrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face your dev partner Max Jai in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Instant Action! (face randomized NPC battles with 5 tiers; lv 20, lv 30, lv 40, lv 50, lv 60)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Upgrade your monsters with ability stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trade / Bartering with NPCs to gain different items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mine for items with your pickaxe in the post game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.poster.avif?t=1747154985\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.webm?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.mp4?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot : </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the developer's for Entodrive AR. An augmented reality game that was made to gamify an outbreak of computer viruses. Your partner in development Max Jai was the face of business, but never got his hands dirty to develop the game. He calls upon your help when realizing Entodrive aren't behaving how they were programed. Entodrive begin attacking and possessing objects in the real world. The Entodrive have become something more than you intended. It is up to you and Max Jai to go on a quest to rediscover what Entodrive means to the people of Cache Isle and save them from Entodrive related incidents. This game takes place in the Apastron universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Monster Taming RPG about collecting magical computer bugs while exploring Cache Isle!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/7425513b9a837afa0ca7501228a79f28bbd03d24/header.jpg?t=1747154985", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747154985", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747154985", "website": "https://www.indiedb.com/games/entodrive", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB Video Memory</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS, Ubuntu, Mint, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB Video Memory</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Noah Lewin"], "publishers": ["Day Dreamer Games"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 599, "final": 599, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$5.99"}, "packages": [53